From 7ddcfca9291fe9336a1ab8f9064d0dd819ddb2a4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 16:41:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] fix(rfork): harden cleanup and planner concurrency

Guard shutdown against reentrant cleanup and unregister its atexit callback after successful finalization. Serialize seed advertisement updates across heartbeat and shutdown, and narrow planner and loader fallback exception handling to expected failures.

Deduplicate exact tensor aliases exposed by implementation objects while preserving distinct shared views. Clarify that planner 404 responses represent idempotent seed absence for RFork clients.

Signed-off-by: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
